From ebf5cab0dd223a36a09742a91be4fea97e46c816 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stanley Jhu <stanleyjhu@google.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 15:08:36 +0800
Subject: scsi: ufs: core: Restore jiffies conversion of device management
 timeouts

Before commit 08b12cda6c44 ("scsi: ufs: core: Switch to
scsi_get_internal_cmd()"), ufshcd_wait_for_dev_cmd() converted the
millisecond timeout with msecs_to_jiffies() before waiting for the
command. That commit moved the timeout to the block layer and assigns the
millisecond value to rq->timeout as is, but rq->timeout is in jiffies. A
1500 ms query timeout (QUERY_REQ_TIMEOUT_DEFAULT) becomes 6 s with
CONFIG_HZ=250 and 15 s with CONFIG_HZ=100, and NOP_OUT_TIMEOUT and
ADVANCED_RPMB_REQ_TIMEOUT grow the same way.

Restore the conversion with msecs_to_jiffies().

Fixes: 08b12cda6c44 ("scsi: ufs: core: Switch to scsi_get_internal_cmd()")
Cc: stable@vger.kernel.org # v6.19+
Signed-off-by: Stanley Jhu <stanleyjhu@google.com>
Reviewed-by: Bart Van Assche <bvanassche@acm.org>
Reviewed-by: Peter Wang <peter.wang@mediatek.com>
Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20261029040003.2100003-2-stanleyjhu@google.com
Signed-off-by: Martin K. Petersen (Oracle) <mkp@kernel.org>
---
 drivers/ufs/core/ufshcd.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/ufs/core/ufshcd.c b/drivers/ufs/core/ufshcd.c
index 4f0301d2a5d4cf..b85b88e4c30861 100644
--- a/drivers/ufs/core/ufshcd.c
+++ b/drivers/ufs/core/ufshcd.c
@@ -3390,7 +3390,7 @@ static int ufshcd_issue_dev_cmd(struct ufs_hba *hba, struct scsi_cmnd *cmd,
 	struct request *rq = scsi_cmd_to_rq(cmd);
 	blk_status_t sts;
 
-	rq->timeout = timeout;
+	rq->timeout = msecs_to_jiffies(timeout);
 	sts = blk_execute_rq(rq, true);
 	if (sts != BLK_STS_OK)
 		return blk_status_to_errno(sts);
-- 
